cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use crategraph in your research, please cite it as below.
title: "crategraph: Researcher-friendly tools for loading, exploring, and visualising RO-Crate data as network graphs"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for analysing and visualising research data collections
  stored in RO-Crates, with a focus on HASS and GLAM applications. crategraph
  loads RO-Crates as network graphs, supports filtering and querying across one
  or many crates, and renders interactive and static visualisations.


  Developed as part of the ARDC Community Data Lab Phase 2, Work Package 2.
  This project is supported by the Australian Research Data Commons (ARDC).
  The ARDC is funded by NCRIS.
